# Video work files and media of each edition (made again from editions/<month>/video/ with the
# engine in videos/monthly-market-review/). work/ never goes to git. final/ keeps its text files
# (title, description, .srt) in git, but not its media.
editions/*/work/
editions/*/final/**/*.mp4
editions/*/final/**/*.mov
editions/*/final/**/*.mp3
editions/*/final/**/*.wav
editions/*/final/**/*.png
editions/*/final/**/*.jpg
editions/*/final/**/*.jpeg
editions/*/final/**/*.webp
